oes to the new mall and gets lost\". Such \"boring\" plotlines and the simplistic art are often a turn-off to non-Japanese audiences, but most Japanese find the show incredibly good. As a result, it continues to be one of the top ratings grabbers on TV and is one of the few anime that is considered \"acceptable\" by adults."},"tags":[{"name":"Educational","rank":90,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Family Life","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Josei","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Slavery","rank":20,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Sazae-san","english":null,"native":"サザエさん","romaji":"Sazae-san","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"海螺小姐"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}